        "action": "Create a public awareness campaign about fibromyalgia",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "The Government should develop and fund a national fibromyalgia awareness campaign, providing accurate information about fibromyalgia, its symptoms and its impact on daily life, and promote this information across NHS services, schools, workplaces and public services.",
